      "title": "GREENLAM: Slightly Lower P/E And Margins Will Shape Balanced Return Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have adjusted their price target on Greenlam Industries slightly from ₹255.25 to ₹254.00, citing updated assumptions for revenue growth, profit margins and a lower forward P/E multiple that together indicate a more measured view of the stock’s fair value. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for May 22, 2026 at 14:30 Indian Standard Time to review the audited standalone and consolidated financial statements for the year ended March 31, 2026, as well as the audited results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026 (Key Developments).",
