      "title": "Greenlam Industries Limited announces Annual dividend, payable on August 28, 2026",
      "body": "Greenlam Industries Limited announced Annual dividend of INR 0.4000 per share payable on August 28, 2026, ex-date on July 03, 2026 and record date on July 03, 2026.",
